          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "E.g. family education, investing in real estate, financial independence."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El Método MonAvi es educación financiera general. No es asesoría de inversión ni recomienda productos o entidades.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The MonAvi Method is general financial education. It is not investment advice and does not recommend products or institutions."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El cashback llega cuando tu amigo registra su primera factura y se confirma. Se premian hasta 10 invitaciones cada 30 días.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cashback arrives when your friend logs their first receipt and it's confirmed. Up to 10 invitations are rewarded every 30 days."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El dinero está bloqueado hasta una fecha": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The money is locked until a date"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El gasto se registra de una vez. Verificamos tu factura al guardarla: si ya está publicada, tu cashback (1%%) se suma enseguida; si no, la volvemos a revisar en 24 horas y queda pendiente hasta confirmarla.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The expense is logged right away. We verify your receipt when you save it: if it's already published, your cashback (1%%) is added immediately; if not, we check again in 24 hours and it stays pending until confirmed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El pago baja de esa cuenta y reduce lo que debes. No cuenta como gasto nuevo: lo que compraste con la tarjeta ya se contó.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The payment comes out of that account and reduces what you owe. It doesn't count as a new expense: what you bought with the card was already counted."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El texto del aviso se lee en tu teléfono y no se guarda: solo el movimiento que confirmes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The alert text is read on your phone and isn't saved: only the transaction you confirm."
          }
        }
      }
    },
